    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9166" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏlossēus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ossiaeus</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Plin. 36, 5, 4, § 26</span></i>),
